OL,3,GNEWSAVan dwellers will not have to pay
OL,4,Afull council tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in vans on "meanwhile
OL,7,Fsites" in Bristol will have their
OL,8,Fcouncil tax payments refunded, after
OL,9,Fthe Valuation Office ruled that
OL,10,Findividual pitches were not eligible
OL,11,Ffor the full fee.
OL,13,FMeanwhile sites are land earmarked for
OL,14,Fdevelopment, where people pay for a
OL,15,Fpitch instead of living on the
OL,16,Froadside. Last April several van
OL,17,Fdwellers objected after the council tax
OL,18,Fcharge was introduced.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
