OL,3,GNEWSAVan dwellers will not have to pay
OL,4,Afull council tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FA letter from the council explained
OL,7,Fthat each site would now be treated
OL,8,Flike a house of multiple occupation,
OL,9,Fwith council tax divided up between
OL,10,Fresidents.
OL,12,F"If you have paid any council tax, any
OL,13,Fcredit on your account will be
OL,14,Frefunded," the letter said.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
